stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> planned: target selected this revision
  planned --> vetoed: a claim contradicted its origin
  planned --> rendered: artefact built within carrier limits
  rendered --> delivered: carrier accepted it
  rendered --> failed: carrier rejected or was unreachable
  failed --> rendered: retried on a later run
  delivered --> delivered: updated in place from a later revision
  delivered --> superseded: a new publication issued for a turn
  delivered --> withdrawn: published in error
  superseded --> [*]
  withdrawn --> [*]
  vetoed --> [*]
